#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:4
msgid "Offline Installations and Upgrades"
msgstr "Offline Installations y Upgrades"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:6
msgid ""
"For customers that have an appliance behind a firewall/proxy that does "
"not allow downloads from our Amazon download site, you can add the "
"supplemental package to add the needed packages the standard Morpheus "
"installer would have downloaded."
msgstr ""
"For customers that have an appliance behind a firewall/proxy that does not "
"allow downloads desde our Amazon download site, you can add the "
"supplemental package to add the needed packages the standard Morpheus "
"installer would have downloaded."

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:9
msgid "Offline Installation Requirements"
msgstr "Offline Installation Requirements"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:11
msgid ""
"NTP should be correctly configured and the server is able to connect to "
"the NTP server in the ntp.conf file"
msgstr ""
"NTP debería ser correctly configured y the server is able to connect a la "
"NTP server en la ntp.conf file"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:12
msgid ""
"The OS package repositories should be configured to use local LAN "
"repository servers or the server should be able to receive packages from "
"the configured repositories"
msgstr ""
"The OS package repositories debería ser configured to use local LAN "
"repository servers o the server debería ser able to receive packages desde "
"la configured repositories"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:13
msgid ""
"The standard Morpheus and supplemental packages must be downloaded from "
"another system and transferred to the Morpheus Appliance server"
msgstr ""
"The standard Morpheus y supplemental packages debe ser downloaded desde "
"another system y transferred to the Morpheus Appliance server"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:14
msgid "The supplemental package is additive, the full installer is also required"
msgstr "The supplemental package is additive, the full installer is also required"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:16
msgid ""
"The supplemental package is linked 1-to-1 to the appliance release. For "
"example the supplemental package for 4.2.1-1 should be used with the "
"appliance package 4.2.1-1"
msgstr ""
"The supplemental package is linked 1-to-1 to el appliance release. Por "
"ejemplo the supplemental package for 4.2.1-1 debería ser used con el "
"appliance package 4.2.1-1"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:19
msgid "Offline Install"
msgstr "Offline Install"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:22
msgid "Ubuntu/Debian"
msgstr "Ubuntu/Debian"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:24
msgid ""
"Download both the regular Morpheus Appliance package and the Supplemental"
" packages on to the appliance server:"
msgstr ""
"Download both the regular Morpheus Appliance package y the Supplemental "
"packages on a la appliance server:"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:26
msgid ""
"wget http://example_url/morpheus-appliance_version_amd64.deb\n"
"wget http://example_url/morpheus-appliance-supplemental_version_all.deb"
msgstr ""
"wget http://example_url/morpheus-appliance_version_amd64.deb\\nwget "
"http://example_url/morpheus-appliance-supplemental_version_all.deb"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:31
#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:67
msgid "Install the both the Appliance package AND the Supplemental package."
msgstr "Install the both the Appliance package AND the Supplemental package."

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:33
msgid ""
"sudo dpkg -i morpheus-appliance_version_amd64.deb\n"
"sudo dpkg -i morpheus-appliance-supplemental_version_all.deb"
msgstr ""
"sudo dpkg -i morpheus-appliance_version_amd64.deb\\nsudo dpkg -i "
"morpheus-appliance-supplemental_version_all.deb"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:38
#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:74
msgid ""
"Set the Morpheus UI appliance url (if needed, hostname will be "
"automatically set)."
msgstr ""
"Set the Morpheus UI appliance url (si es necesario, hostname será "
"automatically set)."

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:40
msgid ""
"# edit appliance_url to resolvable url (if not configured correctly by "
"default)\n"
"\n"
"sudo vi /etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb"
msgstr ""
"# edit appliance_url to resolvable url (if not configurado correctly por "
"defecto)\\n\\nsudo vi /etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:46
#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:82
msgid "Reconfigure the appliance to install required packages"
msgstr "Reconfigure el appliance instalar obligatorio packages"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:48
#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:84
msgid "sudo morpheus-ctl reconfigure"
msgstr "sudo morpheus-ctl reconfigure"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:52
#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:88
msgid ""
"The Chef run should complete successfully. There is a small pause when "
"Chef runs the resource remote_file[package_name] action create while Chef"
" verifies the checksum. After the reconfigure is complete, the morpheus-"
"ui will start and be up in a few minutes."
msgstr ""
"The Chef run should complete successfully. There is a small pause when "
"Chef runs the resource remote_file[package_name] action create while Chef "
"verifies the checksum. After the reconfigure is complete, the morpheus-ui "
"will start y be up in a few minutes."

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:54
msgid ""
"Tail the morpheus log file located at /var/log/morpheus/morpheus-"
"ui/current with the command ``morpheus-ctl tail morpheus-ui`` and look "
"for the Morpheus ascii logo to know when the morpheus-ui is up."
msgstr ""
"Tail the morpheus archivo de registro located at "
"/var/log/morpheus/morpheus-ui/current con the command ``morpheus-ctl tail "
"morpheus-ui`` y look for the Morpheus ascii logo to know cuando el "
"morpheus-ui is up."

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:58
msgid "CentOS/RHEL"
msgstr "CentOS/RHEL"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:60
msgid ""
"Download both the regular Morpheus Appliance package and the matching "
"Supplemental package on to the Appliance server:"
msgstr ""
"Download both the regular Morpheus Appliance package y the matching "
"Supplemental package on to the Appliance server:"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:62
msgid ""
"wget http://example_url/morpheus-appliance_package_url.noarch.rpm\n"
"wget http://example_url/morpheus-"
"appliance_package_supplemental_url.noarch.rpm"
msgstr ""
"wget http://example_url/morpheus-appliance_package_url.noarch.rpm\\nwget "
"http://example_url/morpheus-appliance_package_supplemental_url.noarch.rpm"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:69
msgid ""
"sudo rpm -i morpheus-appliance_package_url.noarch.rpm\n"
"sudo rpm -i morpheus-appliance_package_supplemental_url.noarch.rpm"
msgstr ""
"sudo rpm -i morpheus-appliance_package_url.noarch.rpm\\nsudo rpm -i "
"morpheus-appliance_package_supplemental_url.noarch.rpm"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:76
msgid ""
"#Edit appliance_url to resolvable url (if not configured correctly by "
"default)\n"
"\n"
"sudo vi /etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb"
msgstr ""
"#Edit appliance_url to resolvable url (if not configurado correctly por "
"defecto)\\n\\nsudo vi /etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/offline.rst:90
msgid ""
"Tail the morpheus-ui log file with ``morpheus-ctl tail morpheus-ui`` and "
"look for the Morpheus ascii logo to know when the morpheus-ui is up."
msgstr ""
"Tail the morpheus-ui archivo de registro con ``morpheus-ctl tail "
"morpheus-ui`` y look for the Morpheus ascii logo to know cuando el "
"morpheus-ui is up."

